{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00777","headline":"郊庙歌辞 梁郊祀乐章 庆和 六 · 赵光逢、张衮","name":"郊庙歌辞 梁郊祀乐章 庆和 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天惟佑德，辟乃奉天。\n交感斯在，昭事罔愆。\n岁功已就，王道无偏。\n於焉报本，是用告虔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵光逢、张衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00777.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00777","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}